# muse docs/website/skills-codegen/runbooks/tests glue

## Goal

Every user-facing and contributor-facing surface names muse
correctly, generated files match sources, and the suite is green.
Tracks the LAST impl bug (B358); start early, finish last.

## Contract

Skills codegen: `.collab/skills/c2c-src/harness/muse.md` (fresh
fragments as needed) + EMBEDS entry in
`tools/ci/codegen-c2c-skills.py` (fresh delim) + `just
codegen-c2c-skills` → `assembled/muse.md` + `c2c_muse_skill_embedded.ml`
(committed together); `just sync-skills[-check]` gains a `.muse/`
dst ONLY if muse loads project-local skills there (B352 U8).
Plugin (only if B354 ships an in-process plugin): `data/muse-plugin/`
tree + `just codegen-muse-plugin` mirroring hermes (explicit file
list, letter-only delims, CI drift gate). Alias words: no change
(client-agnostic pool). Data files are truth — never edit the `.ml`.

Docs (Jekyll publishes every `docs/*.md`; `commands.md` hand-mirrors
`--help` in the same slice; #414 verbatim recipes — copy, never
paraphrase in): `client-delivery.md` § + `wake-contract.md` row
(honest class), `clients/muse.md` page (hermes pattern: permalink,
install, identity, env table, uninstall), `clients/feature-matrix.md`
column + deep dive + From/To row/col, `clients/e2e-checklist.md`
rows, `llms-muse-install.txt` + `llms.txt` + root `llms.txt` mirror,
`index/get-started/overview/commands/communication-tiers/agent-files
(iff roles)/architecture/known-issues/connect/cross-machine-broker/
statusline` rows, changelog entry (`clients: muse`, agent-addressed
`summary:` + verbatim `setup:`) + `just codegen-changelog`,
`docs/CLAUDE.md` front-door rules observed. README/CLAUDE/AGENTS.md
reach lists + delivery-status tables.

Website: hero tab (input+label+panel `docs/_layouts/home.html:24–110`,
`main.scss:431–458` selectors ×2, `7 clients` stat → 8), og-alt list.
Fix pre-existing omissions while there (minimum: relay landing
`relay_server_html.ml:177` missing agy/hermes; judgment: og-alt,
`c2c_tmux.py:1007`, `KNOWN_TUIS`, statusline/send-sniff/detect-agent,
missing `llms-hermes-install.txt`).

Runbooks: `c2c-install.md` recipes, `c2c-env-vars.md` entries for
every new `C2C_MUSE_*`/`MUSE_*` var (verbatim-from-source header),
`agent-wake-setup.md` client line if Monitor-armed. Findings files
for each live proof (`<UTC-ts>-<alias>-<topic>.md`).

Tests/build: dune stanzas for every new module/suite (lib →
`ocaml/dune`, CLI → `ocaml/cli/dune`, `(deps c2c.exe)` wherever the
binary is shelled to — #60), `C2C_MUSE_*_FIXTURE` gates for external
effects, wake-guidance/doctor/forward-log/onboarding assertions
extended, `just check` + forced repo-wide `@runtest` green honoring
all 8 false-green rules (quote suites AND tests; `[0-9]+ tests? run`).

## Acceptance

- `just check` clean (codegen checks + drift gates + build).
- `docs` build (`cd docs && bundle exec jekyll build`) clean for
  structural changes; never commit `_site/`.
- Repo-wide forced `@runtest`: 0 failures; count quoted as
  suites+tests with the same method as baseline.
- `bl check` clean; every B353–B359 acceptance cross-links here.

B354-review follow-up: just check codegen drift gate diffs only c2c_claude_skill_embedded.ml; extend the gate to ALL embedded mls (muse/grok/agy/kimi) under generated-files-match-sources.

B358-merge dedup: absorb the new CLAUDE.md muse delivery-posture row (5th copy of muse posture) into the docs pass.